SNOMED CT

This repository does not contain the SNOMED CT terminology. Users must import a
SNOMED CT release they are licensed to use.

SNOMED CT(R) is a registered trademark of the International Health Terminology
Standards Development Organisation (SNOMED International). SNOMED CT content is
copyright SNOMED International.

The demo release generator (clif/devtools/demo_release.py), the tests and the
evaluation sets reference about 100 SNOMED CT concept identifiers together with
their fully specified names and preferred terms. These were checked against the
SNOMED International Global Patient Set (January 2026), which SNOMED
International distributes under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives
4.0 International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/),
available from https://www.snomed.org/gps. The synonyms and translations in the
demo release were written by hand for testing and are not taken from any SNOMED
CT extension or national edition.

