Laya

Clif can use Laya (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya) as an optional
dependency, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Laya is not
vendored in this repository. The training loop in clif/training/train_laya.py
is a single-device adaptation of the training procedure published in Laya's
fine-tuning notebook (notebooks/laya_finetune_typed_decisions_2xT4_kaggle.ipynb,
release v0.3.21).
